    "\n\n## Full Flow — RWA Utility Marketplace\n\n### 1. Deployment\n\n```\nAdmin deploys:\n  HybridProxyAdmin(admin)\n  RWAToken → proxy → initialize(\"RWA\", \"RWA\", supply, admin)\n  RWACertificate → proxy → initialize(\"RWAC\", \"RWAC\", admin, token, feeReceiver)\n  RWAMarketplace → proxy → initialize(token, cert, adminWallet, companyWallet, admin)\n\nAdmin configures:\n  cert.grantRole(MINTER_ROLE, marketplace)\n  cert.grantRole(VENDOR_ROLE, vendor)\n  market.grantRole(VENDOR_ROLE, vendor)\n  market.setPriceFeed(\"warehouse\", chainlinkFeed)\n  market.setPriceFeed(\"gold\", chainlinkFeed)\n  cert.setRedemptionFee(\"warehouse\", 200)  // 2%\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Primary Sale (Vendor → Buyer)\n\n```\nBuyer calls: market.purchaseItem(\"warehouse\", \"WH-001\", \"ipfs://meta\", vendor, 1000e8)\n  │\n  ├─ Oracle converts USD → token amount\n  ├─ 100% pulled from buyer → held in marketplace contract\n  ├─ Escrow #1 created: [vendor=90%, adminWallet=10%]\n  ├─ NFT minted to buyer\n  │\n  ├─ 24h dispute window starts\n  │   ├─ Admin can freezeEscrow(1) → funds locked\n  │   └─ If no freeze...\n  │\n  └─ After 24h:\n      ├─ vendor calls claimEscrow(1) → receives 90%\n      └─ adminWallet calls claimEscrow(1) → receives 10%\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Secondary Sale (P2P Resale)\n\n```\nSeller calls: market.listItem(tokenId, 2000 ether, DIRECT_SALE)\n  │\n  ├─ NFT transferred from seller → marketplace (locked)\n  │\nBuyer calls: market.buyItem(listingId)\n  │\n  ├─ Self-buy blocked (seller ≠ buyer)\n  ├─ 100% pulled from buyer → held in marketplace\n  ├─ Escrow #N created: [seller=90%, adminWallet=10%]\n  ├─ NFT transferred to buyer\n  │\n  └─ After 24h: seller claims 90%, admin claims 10%\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. Rental Flow (Warehouse)\n\n```\nOwner calls: market.listItem(tokenId, price, RENTAL)\n  │\n  ├─ NFT locked in marketplace\n  │\nTenant calls: market.startRental(listingId, 500 ether)\n  │\n  └─ Rental record created (tenant, rentAmount, active)\n\nTenant calls: market.payRent(listingId)  ← repeats each period\n  │\n  ├─ 100% pulled from tenant → held in marketplace\n  ├─ Escrow #N created: [owner=70%, companyWallet=20%, adminWallet=10%]\n  │\n  └─ After 24h: each recipient calls claimEscrow(N)\n       ├─ Owner claims 70%\n       ├─ Company claims 20%\n       └─ Admin claims 10%\n\nSeller (or admin) calls: market.endRental(listingId)\n  │\n  ├─ Rental deactivated\n  └─ Seller can delistItem() → NFT returned\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. Escrow Dispute Flow\n\n```\nWithin 24h of any escrow:\n\n  Admin calls: market.freezeEscrow(escrowId)\n    │\n    ├─ Status → FROZEN\n    ├─ Nobody can claim\n    │\n    └─ Admin investigates, then either:\n        │\n        ├─ resolveEscrow(escrowId, buyerAddr, fullAmount)\n        │   └─ Full refund to buyer (seller loses)\n        │\n        ├─ resolveEscrow(escrowId, sellerAddr, partialAmount)\n        │   └─ Partial resolution (case by case)\n        │\n        └─ unfreezeEscrow(escrowId)\n            └─ Status → CLAIMABLE, recipients can claim immediately\n```\n\n---\n\n### 6. NFT Redemption (Physical Asset Pickup)\n\n```\nBuyer calls: cert.redeem(tokenId)\n  │\n  ├─ Pays redemption fee (e.g., 2%) → feeReceiver\n  ├─ Status: Active → Redeemed\n  ├─ NFT becomes non-transferable\n  │\nBuyer presents NFT proof to vendor (off-chain)\n  │\nVendor calls: cert.markFulfilled(tokenId)\n  │\n  ├─ Status: Redeemed → Fulfilled\n  │\nAdmin calls: cert.burn(tokenId)\n  └─ NFT destroyed after asset handover\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. Dispute on NFT (Certificate Level)\n\n```\nAdmin calls: cert.dispute(tokenId)\n  ├─ Status → Disputed (frozen, non-transferable)\n  │\nAdmin calls: cert.resolveDispute(tokenId, Active)    ← owner wins\n         or: cert.resolveDispute(tokenId, Cancelled) ← owner loses\n```\n\n---\n\n### 8. Admin Emergency Controls\n\n```\nmarket.pause()          → blocks all marketplace operations\nmarket.unpause()        → resumes\nmarket.rescueTokens()   → recover accidentally sent tokens\n\ncert.pause() / unpause()\ncert.cancel(tokenId)    → admin cancels asset (refund path)\n```\n\n---\n\n### Wallet Summary\n\n| Wallet | Role | Receives From |\n|--------|------|---------------|\n| `adminWallet` | Platform fee | 10% of all sales + 10% of all rent |\n| `companyWallet` | Company share | 20% of rent only |\n| Seller/Vendor | Asset owner | 90% of sales, 70% of rent |\n| `feeReceiver` | Certificate fees | Redemption fees |\n[Tool uses: none]",
